@baseUrl = https://localhost:7142
@token = REPLACE_WITH_JWT

### List Reporting DataViews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/dataviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Declarative DataView
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/dataviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Active Members",
  "entityTypeKey": "Ruth.Crm.Person",
  "persistedScheduleIntervalMinutes": 60,
  "rootFilter": {
    "expressionType": "GroupAll",
    "children": [
      {
        "expressionType": "Rule",
        "ruleKind": "EntityProperty",
        "fieldKey": "RecordStatus",
        "operator": "Equals",
        "value": "Active"
      }
    ]
  }
}

### List Reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Merge Templates
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/merge-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Operational Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Revenue & Impact Overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/analytics/revenue-impact
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Executive Insights
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/analytics/executive-insights?windowDays=30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh Star-Schema BI Projections
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/analytics/star-schema/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
